sentences.text:
8. For the foregoing reasons, this Court proceeds to pass the following:
ORDER (i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
(ii) The judgment and award passed by the Tribunal in MVC.No.23/2021 is modified;
(iii) The appellants are entitled for enhanced compensation of Rs.6,62,552/- which shall carry 2017 ACJ 2700 SC NC: 2024:KHC-K:9519 interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition till realization;
(iv) The apportionment shall be in terms of the order of the Tribunal;
(v) The amount in deposit, if any, shall be remitted to the Tribunal forthwith.

